  "docs": [
    {
      "type": "truncatedBlock",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "A trait for testing extremely long documentation that exceeds line limits.",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "This trait provides a comprehensive interface for data processing operations.",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "It demonstrates various method signatures including mutable references,",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "error handling, and different return types. The trait is designed to be",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "flexible and extensible for different use cases in data processing pipelines.",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Each method serves a specific purpose in the data transformation workflow.",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "The implementation should handle edge cases gracefully and provide meaningful",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "error messages when operations fail. This documentation intentionally spans",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "many lines to test the line-based truncation when paragraph truncation",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "doesn't apply. We want to see how the system handles documentation that",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "goes well beyond the 16-line limit and should trigger line-based truncation.",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "This continues for several more lines to ensure we exceed the limit.",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Line 14 of this very long paragraph that should be truncated.",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Line 15 of this extremely verbose documentation example.",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Line 16 which should be the last line shown in brief mode.",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Line 17 that should be hidden and show a truncation indicator.",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Line 18 that definitely won't be visible in brief mode.",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": "Section",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Additional sections after the long paragraph",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "This section should not be visible in brief mode since the first",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "paragraph already exceeded the line limit.",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "level": "Full"
    }
